  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Access to Sexual and Reproductive Health Rights in Palawan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective is to provide contraceptive services in Palawan municipalities that have a high need for the long acting reversible contraceptives (LARCs). The primary beneficiaries of the project is women and girls of reproductive (15-45) age from isolated, rural and difficult to reach communities. Many of these communities have indigenous people living in them</narrative>
  </description>
